{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=May 2018}}

'''Group 4 of the [[1970 FIFA World Cup]]''' was contested in [[León, Guanajuato|León]]'s [[Estadio León|Estadio Nou Camp]] between 2 and 11 June 1970. [[Germany national football team|West Germany]] won the group, and advanced to the quarter-finals, along with [[Peru national football team|Peru]]. [[Bulgaria national football team|Bulgaria]] and [[Morocco national football team|Morocco]] failed to advance.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/1970mexico|title=1970 FIFA World Cup Mexico|publisher=fifa.com|accessdate=9 March 2016}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/70full.html |title=World Cup 1970 |accessdate=10 August 2014 |url-status=live |website=[[RSSSF]] |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160701154217/http://www.rsssf.com/tables/70full.html |archivedate=1 July 2016 }}</ref>

